 ## Jinsi ya kudeploy
 
-Mahitaji kwenye PC: Docker Desktop imewashwa, `docker login -u chiefmaster` (token ya PUSH),
-`ssh contabo` inafanya kazi, na **mabadiliko yote yame-commit** (working tree chafu inakataliwa —
-hakuna flag ya kuiruka).
+Script inaendeshwa kutoka folder lolote. Hali moja kwa kila mara; `-Target` haina default.
 
 ```powershell
-.\deploy\deploy-backend.ps1                # patch: 2.2.58 -> 2.2.59
-.\deploy\deploy-backend.ps1 -Bump minor    # 2.2.59 -> 2.3.0   (au -Bump major)
-.\deploy\deploy-backend.ps1 -Bump none     # toleo lililo kwenye .backend-version, bila kuongeza
+.\deploy\deploy-backend.ps1 -BuildOnly                                   # jenga + tests zote + push (main tu); server haiguswi
+.\deploy\deploy-backend.ps1 -PreflightOnly -Target staging    -Version 2.2.67   # kusoma tu
+.\deploy\deploy-backend.ps1 -Target staging    -Version 2.2.67 [-RefreshStagingDb]
+.\deploy\deploy-backend.ps1 -PreflightOnly -Target production -Version 2.2.67   # kusoma tu
+.\deploy\deploy-backend.ps1 -Target production -Version 2.2.67
 ```
 
-Kinachotokea, kwa mpangilio:
-
-1. **PC — ukaguzi:** git safi, Docker, SSH. Kisha inasoma (read-only) toleo linaloendesha kwenye
-   server na migrations za Flyway ambazo server bado haijaziendesha.
-2. **PC — preflight:** inaonyesha toleo la sasa → jipya, commit, na orodha ya migrations mpya.
-   Lazima uandike `ndio`. Hakuna flag ya kuruka hatua hii.
-3. **PC — build:** `mvn clean package -DskipTests` → `docker build` → `docker push` ya tag kamili
-   (majaribio 3). Hatua yoyote ikishindwa: script inasimama, **server haijaguswa**.
-4. **Server:**
-   1. Inarekodi toleo linaloendesha (lengo la rollback) kwenye `.backend.prev`.
-   2. `docker pull` ya tag mpya — backend ya zamani bado inaendesha. Ikishindwa: inatoka, hakuna kilichobadilika.
-   3. **Backup ya DB:** `~/backup-lsms.sh`; dump lazima iwe mpya, > 5MB, na `pg_restore --list`
-      ipite. Ikishindwa: inatoka, hakuna kilichobadilika. Njia ya dump inachapishwa
-      (`PRE-DEPLOY DUMP: ...`).
-   4. `BACKEND_VERSION=<jipya>` kwenye `.env` — nakala kwanza (`.env.bak.backend.<muda>`, 5 za
-      mwisho zinabaki), mstari huo mmoja tu unabadilishwa, kisha `docker compose config --quiet`
-      na uthibitisho kwamba backend inaelekeza tag sahihi; ikishindwa nakala inarudishwa yenyewe.
-   5. `docker compose up -d --no-deps backend`. `/api` inakuwa chini ~65s (Spring inaanza).
-      Image ya zamani **haifutwi kamwe**.
-   6. **Health check:** hadi sekunde 180 kusubiri `Started LsmsApplication` kwenye log za container
-      **mpya** (ikianguka mapema inagundulika mara moja); kisha kupitia nginx
-      (`Host: elikom.co.tz`): `POST /api/auth/login {}` = **400**, `GET /` = 200 **au** 302 yenye
-      `Location: /v3/`, `GET /index.html` = 200 (Flutter), `GET /v3/` = 200 (V3).
-   7. **Log scan:** mstari wowote wa `ERROR`/`FATAL` au kosa la Flyway **wakati wa startup**
-      (hadi `Started LsmsApplication`) = deploy imeshindwa. `ERROR` za baada ya startup zinatoka
-      kwa wateja halisi (mfano mauzo yaliyokataliwa) — zinachapishwa kama onyo tu.
-   8. Ikishindwa hatua ya 5–7: rollback (tazama chini), exit ≠ 0.
-   9. `DEPLOY_OK <toleo>` inachapishwa baada tu ya ukaguzi wote kupita.
-5. **PC:** baada ya `DEPLOY_OK`, `.backend-version` inaandikwa na ku-commit
-   (`deploy: backend <toleo>`). **`git push` unafanya mwenyewe.**
-
-Deploy ikishindwa, `.backend-version` haibadiliki; tag iliyoshindwa inabaki Docker Hub, kwa hiyo
-deploy inayofuata ya `-Bump patch` itajenga na kusukuma namba ileile upya.
+- Deploy haijengi: inachukua image iliyoko Docker Hub (`-Version`). `-BuildOnly -Version X` au `-Bump minor|major|none`
+  huchagua tag ya kujenga; tag iliyokwisha kusukumwa haijengwi upya.
+- Kila sharti linaandika `SAWA` / `SIYO` / `ONYO` + thamani iliyoonekana, kwenye skrini na
+  `deploy\logs\<toleo>-<target>.log`. Inasimama kwenye `SIYO` ya kwanza. Inauliza `ndio` mara moja tu, kabla ya
+  hatua ya kwanza inayobadilisha kitu. Mwishoni inachapisha amri inayofuata.
+- **Staging:** (hiari `-RefreshStagingDb`: dump ya leo ya B2, sha256, row counts), pull, digest, dump ya staging,
+  up, health check, Flyway (zote success), ERROR za kuanza, alama ya madeni ya wafanyakazi + AR kabla/baada,
+  prod ps kabla/baada. Ikipita: `~/.lsms-staging-passed/backend-<toleo>` (digest) kwenye server.
+- **Production:** preflight (toleo la sasa, digest, migrations), dump iliyothibitishwa + lazima iwe B2, deploy,
+  health check, rollback ya image, alama kabla/baada (prod iko hewani: tofauti ni `ONYO`, si kosa).
+- **Kizuizi cha staging:** toleo lenye migration inayosubiri, au lenye mabadiliko ya GL / sales / madeni tangu
+  toleo linaloendesha prod, linakataliwa mpaka staging iwe imepita kwa digest ileile. Toleo lisilo na vyote viwili
+  linapita moja kwa moja. Dharura: `-SkipStagingGate -Reason "<sababu>"`; inarekodiwa kwenye
+  `~/lsms-deployment/deploy-gate-overrides.log` na kwenye log ya PC.
+- Baada ya `DEPLOY_OK` ya production tu: `.backend-version` inaandikwa na kucommitiwa (push ni yako).
 
